<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλλ-ᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exchange</i>, esp. of money,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1346b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.100.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>money-changer's profit, agio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				50.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				66.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				3.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>freight, merchandise</i>, metaph., [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραὶ</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρεῖαι
				κ</span>.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				767
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>change, difference</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.74
			</span></i> K. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>change from enmity to friendship, reconciliation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλλαγὰς ποιεῖσθαι πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1588
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reconciliation</i> of sinners <i>with God</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				5.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					11.15
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
